{"id":"n71305-1-12","stage":1,"title":"파란색 · 湛绿色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71305-1-12-1","ko":"너는 무슨 색을 제일 좋아해?","zh":"你最喜欢什么颜色？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"색을","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색을","audio":"/audio/184eccbbdcf346a6008d.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아해","audio":"/audio/ef5074f85cc0a689d2ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e1a5191dbfc4c4cfb843.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71305-1-12-2","ko":"파란색. 시원하고 상쾌한 느낌이 좋거든.","zh":"蓝色。因为我觉得它给人一种清爽凉快的感觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"파란색.","meaning":"湛绿色，湛蓝色","explanation":"파란색：湛绿色，湛蓝色","readings":[{"term":"파란색","audio":"/audio/53ca6b594a240acca9a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71305","senseId":"1","lemma":"파란색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파란색","audio":"/audio/53ca6b594a240acca9a5.mp3"}},{"text":"시원하고","meaning":"凉爽，凉快","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하고","audio":"/audio/e19c0f1cbbba8579ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"상쾌한","meaning":"清爽，清新","explanation":"상쾌하다：清爽，清新；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"상쾌하다","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16227","senseId":"1","lemma":"상쾌하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상쾌한","audio":"/audio/57efb0c9e31434c0482c.mp3"}},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느낌이","audio":"/audio/160aa45adfe9857278de.mp3"}},{"text":"좋거든.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋거든","audio":"/audio/dcb53a92f04251593cc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"53ca6b594a240acc","term":"파란색","zh":"湛绿色，湛蓝色","audio":"/audio/53ca6b594a240acca9a5.mp3","entryId":"71305","definition":"如晴朗的天空或大海一样明亮而鲜明的蓝色。","pronunciation":["파란색"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"e6de708c58b3dd5e","term":"상쾌하다","zh":"清爽，清新","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3","entryId":"16227","definition":"心情或感觉等清凉而爽快。","pronunciation":["상ː쾌하다"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/10edf60bb1f21c88847b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71305","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["蓝色。因为我觉得它给人一种清爽凉快的感觉。","你最喜欢什么颜色？","最近早餐都吃些什么呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最喜欢什么颜色？","最近早餐都吃些什么呢？","蓝色。因为我觉得它给人一种清爽凉快的感觉。"],"answer":2}]}
